      "status": "PASS",
      "rationale": "Qualification trigger, local display updates, repeated input comparison, independent exercises and restart are explicitly teaching design. UI reset clears teaching selections/feedback only and expressly cannot restore real business records; no missing source reset is claimed. Selfchecks contain reasons/misconceptions/source/retry but no scoring/stable-mastery assertion. All actual outputs are guide natural language/tables, without HTML/code/files, executable creation, concrete production-tool instructions or external execution.",
